    {
      "contentTypeKey": "e0876897-88f4-4dcf-ae0a-ec5a37e3a185",
      "text": {
        "markup": "<h2 class=\"govuk-heading-s\" style=\"color: rgb(61, 61, 61); font-family: 'Open Sans', Arial, sans-serif; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; font-weight: bold; font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.5; display: block; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 20px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\">Footer bar</h2>\n<p style=\"color: rgb(61, 61, 61); font-family: 'Open Sans', Arial, sans-serif; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; font-weight: 400; font-size: medium; line-height: 1.5; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 20px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\" class=\"govuk-body\">The TPR footer bar is one component usually present at the bottom of pages across the site</p>\n<p style=\"color: rgb(61, 61, 61); font-family: 'Open Sans', Arial, sans-serif; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; font-weight: 400; font-size: medium; line-height: 1.5; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 20px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\" class=\"govuk-body\">It supports localisation / culture variance and consists&nbsp;of three areas:</p>\n<ul class=\"govuk-list govuk-list--bullet\" style=\"font-family: 'Open Sans', Arial, sans-serif; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; font-weight: 400; font-size: medium; line-height: 1.5; color: rgb(61, 61, 61); margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 20px; padding-left: 20px; list-style-type: disc; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\">\n<li style=\"margin-bottom: 5px;\">the TPR logo</li>\n<li style=\"margin-bottom: 5px;\">links (optional)</li>\n<li style=\"margin-bottom: 5px;\">a copyright statement</li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"color: rgb(61, 61, 61); font-family: 'Open Sans', Arial, sans-serif; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; font-weight: 400; font-size: medium; line-height: 1.5; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 20px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\" class=\"govuk-body\">It is possible for the logo not to be linked, as demonstrated in the second example.</p>",
        "blocks": {
